{"task_id": "HumanEval/63", "solution": "def fibfib(n: int):\n    \"\"\"Computes the n-th FibFib number using an iterative approach for efficiency.\"\"\"\n    if n == 0 or n == 1:\n        return 0\n    if n == 2:\n        return 1\n\n    # Initialize the first three FibFib numbers: fibfib(0), fibfib(1), fibfib(2)\n    f0, f1, f2 = 0, 0, 1\n\n    # Iterate from n=3 up to the requested n\n    for _ in range(3, n + 1):\n        next_fib = f0 + f1 + f2\n        f0 = f1\n        f1 = f2\n        f2 = next_fib\n\n    return f2"}
{"task_id": "HumanEval/64", "solution": "def vowels_count(s):\n    \"\"\"Counts the number of vowels in a string, including 'y' if it's the last character.\"\"\"\n    vowel_chars = {'a', 'e', 'i', 'o', 'u'}\n    count = 0\n    s_lower = s.lower()\n    n = len(s_lower)\n\n    for i in range(n):\n        char = s_lower[i]\n        if char in vowel_chars:\n            count += 1\n        elif char == 'y' and i == n - 1:\n            count += 1\n\n    return count"}
